1587                 /       AS WRITTEN, THE TRIGONOMETRIC FUNCTION PACKAGES ARE INTERDEPENDENT, THUS
1588                 /       IT IS IMPOSSIBLE TO HAVE ATN, LOG, EXP WITHOUT SIN, COS.
1589   
1590                 /       BY TAKING ADVANTAGE OF CODE OPTIMIZATION TECHNIQUES, COINCIDENCES OF
1591                 /       ASSEMBLY AND SMALL HOLES IN THE AREA, THE TWO PACKAGES CAN BE SPLIT. THIS
1592                 /       ALLOWS THE ATN, LOG, EXP PACKAGE TO BE SELECTED ALONE BY RELOCATING IT TO
1593                 /       THE AREA FORMERLY OCCUPIED BY SIN, COS. THIS SAVES EXACTLY ONE PAGE OF
1594                 /       FOCAL BUFFER SPACE.
